"or the user manually set that the device performed tests (set as Reported "
"Active) - Down/Red: the user manually set that the device is down - Unknown/"
"Yellow: there aren't tests registered for the device and the user didn't set "
"any status - Not Recorded/Grey: something is going wrong with Aspect, "
"because it didn't set any status - needs attention"
